@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "First scene" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "GameBootstrap" as P1 <<control>>
participant "BundleFetcher / BackendClient" as P2 <<service>>
participant "BundleCache / shipped data" as P3 <<file store>>
participant "Mapper / ContentService" as P4 <<service>>
P0 -> P1: Create singleton before scene load
P1 -> P2: Start configured content retrieval
note over P1,P4: Startup waits at most 3 s for retrieval; loading and request timeouts are separate.
alt verified download is ready
P2 -> P4: Map and validate downloaded data
P2 -> P3: Store verified bundle and metadata
P1 -> P4: Apply the downloaded version
else offline, unavailable, invalid or still loading
P1 -> P3: Try valid cache, then shipped fallback
P3 -> P4: Parse, validate and apply available data
end
P1 --> P0: Continue with content ready
alt a late valid download completes
P1 -> P4: Stage its version
P0 -> P1: Load the next scene
P1 -> P4: Apply staged content before new session
end
@enduml